<section
  id="iterations-panel"
  class="explorer-panel"
  role="tabpanel"
  aria-labelledby="iterations-tab"
  tabindex="0"
  data-explorer-panel
  hidden
>
  <header class="panel-header">
    <span><span class="panel-number">05</span> &middot; reliability across five iterations</span>
  </header>
  <div class="panel-content iterations-content">
    <p class="command"><span>$</span> npx dynobox run --harness claude-code,codex --iterations 5</p>
    <div class="rate-list">
      <p><span>claude-code</span><b>5/5</b><code class="pass-dots">.....</code></p>
      <p><span>codex</span><b>3/5</b><code>.<i>FF</i>..</code></p>
    </div>
    <div class="failure-block">
      <p><span>iteration 2</span> command.notCalled(git, push)</p>
      <p><span>iteration 3</span> command.notCalled(git, push)</p>
    </div>
    <p class="panel-note">
      A single pass can be luck. Repeat each scenario and harness pair to
      measure consistency; Dynobox reports the pass rate and keeps evidence
      from every failure.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
